<title>SPAIN: Buba Schieber-Germany has not done fiscal homework.</title>
<headline>Buba Schieber-Germany has not done fiscal homework.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bundesbank board member Helmut Schieber said on Monday that some core European Union nations, including Germany, have not done their fiscal homework.</p>
<p>Speaking at a conference on European economic and monetary union, he said: &quot;Some of the core countries have not done fiscal homework, including my country.&quot;</p>
<p>&quot;The questioning of the stability pact is undermining the confidence of the financial markets,&quot; he added.</p>
</text>
